Comment:
▪️If you have oily acne prone skin, then using a salicylic acid  in your routine can be beneficial. 

▪️Salicylic acid reduces stickiness of cells and facilitates easy extrusion of oil produced by sebaceous glands. 

▪️Salicylic acid helps in reducing acne as well as blackheads and whiteheads. 

▪️You can use a salicylic acid cleanser or serum or both depending on requirements. 

▪️Salicylic acid is best used at light but if you are already using retinol at night then add a salicylic acid serum in the morning. 

✅Here are a few recommendations for serums and cleansers *notsponsored*

